# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF on every OS, whatever
# core.autocrlf says (Git for Windows sets it to true system-wide). The sample maps in maps/
# must stay LF so they regenerate byte for byte (tests/test_mapgen.py checks this).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary outputs: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
